# otel_collector.fc
# No host file contexts required for v1.
#  - /var/log/pods/* is already container_log_t (shipped container.fc).
#  - The configMap (/etc/otel) and secret env are kubelet-projected as
#    container_file_t at the pod MCS level at runtime.
#  - otel_collector_t is entered via the containerd runtime transition
#    (kubernetes_container in the .te), NOT by labelling a host binary,
#    so there is no otel_collector_exec_t entry.
#
# If a host-side exec wrapper were ever added, its single line would be:
#   /usr/local/bin/otel-wrapper -- gen_context(system_u:object_r:otel_collector_exec_t,s0)
